Dialogue: 0,0:00:00.00,0:00:01.08,Cap,,0,0,0,,e aí, você gostou,
Dialogue: 0,0:00:01.08,0:00:01.24,Cap,,0,0,0,,Yasmin?
Dialogue: 0,0:00:01.24,0:00:01.90,Cap,,0,0,0,,eu gostei, mas
Dialogue: 0,0:00:01.90,0:00:03.20,Cap,,0,0,0,,quanto você faz ele no pix?
Dialogue: 0,0:00:03.20,0:00:03.88,Cap,,0,0,0,,ó, esse daqui
Dialogue: 0,0:00:03.88,0:00:05.04,Cap,,0,0,0,,eu consigo fazer ele
Dialogue: 0,0:00:05.04,0:00:07.62,Cap,,0,0,0,,por {\c&H6BE239&}R$ 3.950{\c&HFFFFFF&}
Dialogue: 0,0:00:07.62,0:00:09.68,Cap,,0,0,0,,esse daqui, o C85,
Dialogue: 0,0:00:09.68,0:00:11.80,Cap,,0,0,0,,por {\c&H6BE239&}R$ 2.500{\c&HFFFFFF&}
Dialogue: 0,0:00:11.80,0:00:12.82,Cap,,0,0,0,,tá bom, então vou levar
Dialogue: 0,0:00:12.82,0:00:13.14,Cap,,0,0,0,,um pra mim,
Dialogue: 0,0:00:13.14,0:00:13.90,Cap,,0,0,0,,um pro meu filho
Dialogue: 0,0:00:13.90,0:00:14.90,Cap,,0,0,0,,ai, legal
Dialogue: 0,0:00:15.02,0:00:16.18,Cap,,0,0,0,,ah, Yasmin, e aí,
Dialogue: 0,0:00:16.18,0:00:17.10,Cap,,0,0,0,,você gostou,
Dialogue: 0,0:00:17.10,0:00:18.52,Cap,,0,0,0,,vai querer levar?
Dialogue: 0,0:00:18.86,0:00:20.04,Cap,,0,0,0,,ai, não sei
Dialogue: 0,0:00:20.04,0:00:20.84,Cap,,0,0,0,,eu queria que combinasse
Dialogue: 0,0:00:20.84,0:00:22.24,Cap,,0,0,0,,com a bancada lá de casa
Dialogue: 0,0:00:22.24,0:00:23.56,Cap,,0,0,0,,mas eu tenho os dois modelos
Dialogue: 0,0:00:23.56,0:00:25.50,Cap,,0,0,0,,em outras cores também
Dialogue: 0,0:00:25.50,0:00:26.06,Cap,,0,0,0,,ah, mas eu queria
Dialogue: 0,0:00:26.06,0:00:26.58,Cap,,0,0,0,,que combinasse
Dialogue: 0,0:00:26.58,0:00:27.74,Cap,,0,0,0,,com a minha personalidade
Dialogue: 0,0:00:27.74,0:00:30.16,Cap,,0,0,0,,ó, vamos fazer assim, então?
Dialogue: 0,0:00:30.16,0:00:31.82,Cap,,0,0,0,,só pra te mimar, tá?
Dialogue: 0,0:00:31.82,0:00:33.56,Cap,,0,0,0,,é só com você
Dialogue: 0,0:00:33.56,0:00:34.14,Cap,,0,0,0,,ai, eu sei,
Dialogue: 0,0:00:34.14,0:00:35.64,Cap,,0,0,0,,eu sou um ótimo cliente
Dialogue: 0,0:00:36.12,0:00:37.92,Cap,,0,0,0,,pra melhorar o seu pacote,
Dialogue: 0,0:00:37.92,0:00:39.16,Cap,,0,0,0,,como você vai estar adquirindo
Dialogue: 0,0:00:39.16,0:00:41.12,Cap,,0,0,0,,o aparelho na pré-Black,
Dialogue: 0,0:00:41.12,0:00:42.42,Cap,,0,0,0,,no dia da Black,
Dialogue: 0,0:00:42.42,0:00:43.60,Cap,,0,0,0,,você pode voltar aqui
Dialogue: 0,0:00:43.60,0:00:44.54,Cap,,0,0,0,,e você consegue
