Dialogue: 0,0:00:44.54,0:00:47.12,HL1,,0,0,0,,{\alpha&HA8&\c&HD0D0D0&\t(0,80,\alpha&H00&\c&HFFFFFF&)}esse {\alpha&HA8&\c&HD0D0D0&\t(170,250,\alpha&H00&\c&HFFFFFF&)}fone {\alpha&HA8&\c&HD0D0D0&\t(390,470,\alpha&H00&\c&HFFFFFF&)}oficial {\alpha&HA8&\c&HD0D0D0&\t(990,1070,\alpha&H00&\c&HFFFFFF&)}realme
